# Allow-list: only the paths below are published. Everything else in this
# folder is Apple software (OTA, IPSWs, extracted binaries, shared cache,
# device trees, disassembly), data pulled out of a VM (logs, crash reports,
# plists, keybags, screenshots) or local build output, and stays local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/patches/
!/scripts/

# Compiled helper; built locally from scripts/dsc_extract.c.
/scripts/dsc_extract

# Never commit these, even if one lands inside an allowed folder.
.DS_Store
*.ips
*.log
*.aea
*.ipsw
*.im4p
*.kb
*.logarchive/
*.otool.txt
